    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Voice Receptionist (the n8n side)\nYour voice platform (ElevenLabs, Vapi or Retell) talks to the caller. When it needs to look something up it calls this webhook. Four tools: **check_availability**, **book_appointment**, **take_message**, and **call_summary** after the call.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Google Sheet with tabs **Bookings**, **Messages**, **Call Log** (headers in the README). Paste its URL into the 3 Sheets nodes.\n2. Connect Google Calendar, Google Sheets and Gmail.\n3. Fill **Your Settings**: hours, time zone, a **secretKey**.\n4. Activate, copy the Production URL of **Call Comes In**, and add the tools on your voice platform (README has the exact JSON).\n5. Send the test requests in the README before you take a real call.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "fdabe21a-d64e-4e34-b875-c33204c2eb05",
      "name": "Note: START HERE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        -560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Your Settings\nOpen days, hours and appointment length decide the slots. **minimumNoticeMinutes** stops same-minute bookings. **secretKey**: every request must send it as header `x-receptionist-key` or `?key=`.",
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "4fc40546-f2a6-4f1e-acf7-ce7d669e4ae8",
      "name": "Note: Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        176,
        -176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Check and book\nOne calendar read covers the requested day and the next week. A booking is re-checked against the live calendar right before it is created, so two callers can not take the same slot. If the time is taken, the reply offers the nearest open times.",
        "height": 136,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "61fafc8d-0a93-4170-a747-82ef9ff466ee",
      "name": "Note: Booking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
